{"ordinal":16123,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482505","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_DontShoot_00b0541","source":"Mother: Иногда хочется ничего не слышать. Совсем. Но когда дети засыпают, наступает такая тишина... Ради этого и живёшь.","target":"Mother: Uneori îmi doresc să nu mai aud nimic. Nimic. Dar când adorm copiii, se lasă o liniște... Pentru ea merită să trăiești.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16124,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482504","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_DontShoot_0a2f4ef","source":"Mother: Знаешь, однажды я нашла фото, на котором все дети улыбаются. Смотрела на него всю ночь, пока не уснула.","target":"Mother: Știi, odată am găsit o fotografie în care toți copiii zâmbeau. M-am uitat la ea toată noaptea, până am adormit.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16125,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482503","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_DontShoot_0fb8b5c","source":"Mother: Однажды так замоталась, что неделю не мылась. Дети даже не заметили.","target":"Mother: Odată am fost atât de ocupată, încât nu m-am spălat o săptămână. Copiii nici n-au observat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16126,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482502","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_DontShoot_0b00582","source":"Mother: Когда ребёнок болеет, ты сутки напролёт не спишь. А потом привыкаешь. И просто живёшь в этом кошмаре.","target":"Mother: Când un copil e bolnav, nu dormi zi și noapte. Apoi te obișnuiești. Și pur și simplu trăiești în coșmarul ăsta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16127,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482501","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_DontShoot_0b3d4e5","source":"Mother: Руки... Я ими детей обнимала, всё по дому делала и мужа ласкала. И знаешь что? Всё равно никто нихера не ценит.","target":"Mother: Mâinile... Cu ele mi-am îmbrățișat copiii, am făcut totul prin casă și mi-am mângâiat soțul. Și știi ce? Tot nu apreciază nimeni nimic, futu-i.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16128,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482500","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_DontShoot_0b8e0bf","source":"Mother: Знаешь, у одного из моих детей зубы идеальные. Так и не улыбнулся ни разу. Может, дело вообще не в зубах?","target":"Mother: Știi, unul dintre copiii mei are dinți perfecți. N-a zâmbit niciodată. Poate că nu dinții contează?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16129,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482499","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Death_0e63187","source":"Mother: Как же страшно…","target":"Mother: Ce frică mi-e…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16130,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482498","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Death_0b67ecd","source":"Mother: Наконец-то никто не будет меня донимать…","target":"Mother: În sfârșit n-o să mă mai bată nimeni la cap…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16131,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482497","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_Gun_03294f3","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16132,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451813482496","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_Gun_0435fc6","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16133,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288203","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_Gun_087e885","source":"Mother: Ты точно больной, если из-за ушей стрелять собрался. Чем они тебе так не понравились? Ну, я могу их платочком прикрыть!","target":"Mother: Sigur ești bolnav la cap dacă vrei să tragi pentru niște urechi. Ce nu-ți place la ele? Pot să le acopăr cu o batistă!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16134,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288202","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_Gun_09ebe2a","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16135,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288201","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_Gun_048692b","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16136,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288200","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_Gun_0a2cb64","source":"Mother: Ты что, по фотке судишь? Вот умора.","target":"Mother: Ce, judeci după o fotografie? Ce mai glumă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16137,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288199","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_Gun_0622d4a","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16138,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288198","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_Gun_0e6826c","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16139,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288197","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_Gun_004dc58","source":"Mother: Ты что, из-за запаха решил меня пристрелить? Умора.","target":"Mother: Ce, ai hotărât să mă împuști din cauza mirosului? Ce mai glumă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16140,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288196","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_Gun_0e814d9","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16141,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288195","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_Gun_0dd32b6","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16142,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288194","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_Gun_0d8b789","source":"Mother: Да хоть гранату достань. Выспаться мне это не поможет.","target":"Mother: Scoate și o grenadă dacă vrei. Tot n-o să mă ajute să dorm.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16143,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288193","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_Gun_08e3cf1","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16144,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451809288192","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_Gun_0402d2d","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16145,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093898","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_Gun_0fbb0c1","source":"Mother: Эти руки тебе суп сварят, если доживёшь! А ты за ружьё…","target":"Mother: Mâinile astea îți vor face supă, dacă apuci să trăiești! Iar tu scoți pușca…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16146,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093897","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_Gun_0bffbf9","source":"Mother: У меня от бытовых средств уже сыпь какая-то. Не успела ко врачу сходить.","target":"Mother: Am făcut o erupție de la soluțiile de curățat. N-am apucat să merg la medic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16147,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093896","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_Gun_05076b9","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16148,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093895","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_Gun_06037d3","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16149,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093894","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_Gun_0550b99","source":"Mother: А зубы жёлтые всё равно, с такими детьми как не закурить?","target":"Mother: Dar dinții tot galbeni sunt. Cu asemenea copii, cum să nu mă apuc de fumat?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16150,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093893","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_Gun_0b4086e","source":"Mother: Да у меня уже неделю при чистке зубов кровь идёт.","target":"Mother: De o săptămână îmi sângerează gingiile când mă spăl pe dinți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16151,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093892","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_0a301b6","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16152,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093891","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_0f771e3","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16153,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093890","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_0a9fefa","source":"Mother: Я уже не слышу половину из-за детских визгов.","target":"Mother: De la țipetele copiilor nu mai aud jumătate din ce mi se spune.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16154,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093889","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Ears_0f474b8","source":"Mother: Я давно их не чистила. Может, уже пробка образовалась.","target":"Mother: Nu mi-am mai curățat urechile de mult. Poate s-a format deja un dop.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16155,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451805093888","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_0352aa1","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16156,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899594","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_0023bc7","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16157,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899593","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_0d569a7","source":"Mother: Растрёпанная и злая, как обычно.","target":"Mother: Ciufulită și furioasă, ca de obicei.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16158,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899592","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Photo_0f5cc95","source":"Mother: Можно мне присесть? Нет?","target":"Mother: Pot să mă așez? Nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16159,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899591","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_085db77","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16160,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899590","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_0ef6e9b","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16161,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899589","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_061134e","source":"Mother: Дезик давно закончился. Ты уж не обессудь.","target":"Mother: Mi s-a terminat deodorantul de mult. Să nu mi-o iei în nume de rău.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16162,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899588","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Armpit_0d92f59","source":"Mother: Ну, смотри.","target":"Mother: Ei, uită-te.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16163,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899587","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_078fbde","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16164,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899586","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_024c8d5","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16165,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899585","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_0dbb521","source":"Mother: Видишь огроменные мешки? Это от недосыпа…","target":"Mother: Vezi pungile astea uriașe de sub ochi? Sunt de la lipsa somnului…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16166,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451800899584","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Eyes_041989a","source":"Mother: Ну, смотри.","target":"Mother: Ei, uită-te.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16167,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705289","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_04abc18","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16168,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705288","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_0fc585a","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16169,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705287","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_0ad2ad2","source":"Mother: Лопаты, а не ладони. Всё для детей.","target":"Mother: Am lopeți în loc de palme. Totul pentru copii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16170,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705286","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Hands_07f2535","source":"Mother: Вот, смотри.","target":"Mother: Poftim, uită-te.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16171,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705285","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_089b4d3","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16172,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705284","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_0f8e703","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16173,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705283","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_09add44","source":"Mother: Знаешь, раньше я не обращала на них внимания. Времени просто не было. А теперь... Теперь жалею.","target":"Mother: Știi, înainte nu le dădeam atenție. Pur și simplu n-aveam timp. Iar acum... acum regret.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16174,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705282","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_Teeth_018248c","source":"Mother: Ну пожалуйста.","target":"Mother: Hai, te rog.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-403.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16175,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705281","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_WannaCheck_0c0e966","source":"Уши","target":"Urechi","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16176,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451796705280","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_WannaCheck_0bc05eb","source":"Фото","target":"Fotografie","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16177,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451792510985","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Mother_WannaCheck_035e11b","source":"Подмышки","target":"Axile","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
